{"4533330": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "A Game About Media & Warfare", "steam_appid": 4533330, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4533330/extras/45ed2f2213dd69103e5b694f4b18768e.poster.avif?t=1783450974\" width=920 height=1080 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4533330/extras/45ed2f2213dd69103e5b694f4b18768e.webm?t=1783450974\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4533330/extras/45ed2f2213dd69103e5b694f4b18768e.mp4?t=1783450974\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Media &amp; Warfare is a singleplayer FPS game inspired by late-2000s design with modern boomer shooter influences. Slide behind walls to heal, rack up massive killstreaks, and process the collective trauma of 9/11 like it's 2007.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4533330/extras/0a62279232b7d65d13f7d9a4e797d1ac.avif?t=1783450974\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4533330/extras_big/0a62279232b7d65d13f7d9a4e797d1ac.webp?t=1783450974 width=1560 height=251 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4533330/extras/ed45d054578373a825a8ca618b7e21e5.poster.avif?t=1783450974\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4533330/extras/ed45d054578373a825a8ca618b7e21e5.webm?t=1783450974\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4533330/extras/ed45d054578373a825a8ca618b7e21e5.mp4?t=1783450974\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each level is designed to give a feeling of progress. Good pacing is what makes a linear shooter work and it's one of the main aspects I focused on while making the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >My approach to replayability is making levels that are intrinsically fun to run through again and again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4533330/extras/53ea26ade2e97ea011ed139a12cfe0b3.avif?t=1783450974\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4533330/extras_big/53ea26ade2e97ea011ed139a12cfe0b3.webp?t=1783450974 width=1560 height=251 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4533330/extras/68ae83b1959fd7299c42d1c44ab9f3aa.poster.avif?t=1783450974\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4533330/extras/68ae83b1959fd7299c42d1c44ab9f3aa.webm?t=1783450974\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4533330/extras/68ae83b1959fd7299c42d1c44ab9f3aa.mp4?t=1783450974\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spend your killstreak on grenades and seeing enemies through walls. Summon air strikes through the power of the military industrial complex in your American veins.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4533330/extras/f73c5ac8a0c1f7a253812425c9703edc.avif?t=1783450974\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4533330/extras_big/f73c5ac8a0c1f7a253812425c9703edc.webp?t=1783450974 width=1560 height=251 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4533330/extras/4366d885b81f9f8a5dc5366e92431735.poster.avif?t=1783450974\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4533330/extras/4366d885b81f9f8a5dc5366e92431735.webm?t=1783450974\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4533330/extras/4366d885b81f9f8a5dc5366e92431735.mp4?t=1783450974\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hiding behind walls to heal is back and sped up for your convenience. Media &amp; Warfare is a blend of cover based action sped up by indie boomer shooter movement.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4533330/extras/45ed2f2213dd69103e5b694f4b18768e.poster.avif?t=1783450974\" width=920 height=1080 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4533330/extras/45ed2f2213dd69103e5b694f4b18768e.webm?t=1783450974\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4533330/extras/45ed2f2213dd69103e5b694f4b18768e.mp4?t=1783450974\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Media &amp; W